<div class="fade-section story-section">

    <div class="parallax">
        <img src="@Image"
             class="story-image" />
    </div>

    <div class="story-text">

        <h2>The Little Things</h2>

        <p>
            After everything we’ve experienced together, the things I think about most
            aren’t always the big moments. They’re the small, everyday ones that somehow
            ended up meaning the most.
        </p>

        <ul class="little-things-list">
            <li>Being cabezones</li>
            <li>Matching our big back activities</li>
            <li>How playful we are with each other</li>
            <li>Knowing you're always my Player 2</li>
            <li>Our inside jokes — "Que es eso?!?"</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

</div>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public string Image { get; set; } = "";
}